#: src/Receiver/Preflight.php:119
msgid "64-bit PHP"
msgstr ""

#: src/Receiver/Preflight.php:120
msgid "At least one of the two sites runs 32-bit PHP. Files larger than about 2 GB cannot be listed or copied reliably on that build."
msgstr ""

#: src/Receiver/Preflight.php:122
msgid "On 32-bit PHP, file sizes and byte offsets wrap above 2 GB, so a large Media Library can fail or loop."
msgstr ""

#: src/Receiver/Preflight.php:123
msgid "Use 64-bit PHP on both sites for libraries that may contain files over 2 GB. Smaller libraries can still copy on 32-bit PHP."
